%# these settings can be adjusted by some copy-paste.                                                          #
%# The worst homework is dropped, then the sum is computed, and a grade is assigned                            #
%# based on the grading preferences set.                                                                       #
%# Averages and average grades are also computed. Students dropping the course                                 #
%# or getting an Incomplete are also handled.                                                                  #
%#                                                                                                             #
%# Data concerning the course is entered at the beginning, students' points are entered at the end of the file.#
%#                                                                                                             #
%###############################################################################################################

