                                                  %should agree with the max. points for each homework

%This computes the maximum points during the semester: homeworks + exams - the max. points to be dropped
\newcounter{max}\setcounter{max}{\thehwa+\thehwb+\thehwc+\thehwd+\thehwe+\thehwf+\thehwg+\thehwh+\thehwi+\thehwj+\thehwk+\theexa+\theexb+\thefex-\thedrop}

